{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hurley The Hyrax is an arcade-style game inspired by early 1980s arcade classics. Play as Hurley, a hyrax who's had all his flowers stolen by the diabolical Serval Squad. Bring all the flowers back to your cave before the servals stop you. Lick the servals to stun them before they get you. And watch out for the traveler, bringing you bonuses and power-ups. Play through an endless series of levels to get the high score, and maybe find love along the way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 unique level themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normal, Easy, and Turbo modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable hats through challenges</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611650?t=1745454382","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611650?t=1745454382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611650/29fe90152efe0f4c0aeca3b3d9e21c2b1434e024/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745454382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611650/29fe90152efe0f4c0aeca3b3d9e21c2b1434e024/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745454382","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hurley The Hyrax is an arcade-style game inspired by early 1980s arcade classics. Play as Hurley, a hyrax who's had all his flowers stolen by the diabolical Serval Squad. Bring all the flowers back to your cave before the servals stop you. Lick